    {
      "build": 17,
      "date": "2026-11-26",
      "bench": false,
      "notes": "K-line + CAN bridge firmware 387. With a DME carrying the CAN broadcast patch it reads boost, timing, knock, IAT and the rest off CAN into the SD log and the dash screen, and leaves the K-line alone while the broadcast arrives. Sends the dash lights' level to the dash screen (Dim with dash lights). A program write goes on when the ECU's program isn't the backup's and says so, and reads back only the signature at the end. Update keeps your settings.",
